{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["visionOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"YBVRSlider","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Dragging moves the thumb from where it is, by as much as the drag - it does not jump to the touch.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"seekingValue","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" follows the drag continuously, between ","type":"text"},{"code":"onScrubBegan","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"onScrubEnded","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"while the thumb holds still against "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"value"},{"type":"text","text":" until the scrub is over."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Once it is, the thumb stays where it was let go until "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"value"},{"type":"text","text":" catches up, rather than"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"jumping back to where playback was while the host’s seek is still under way."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"trackHeight"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"thumbSize"},{"type":"text","text":" size the track and the thumb. A thumb smaller than the track"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sits inside it, a larger one overhangs it, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0"},{"type":"text","text":" leaves it off - for a bar that only shows"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"progress."}],"type":"para